.TH LOU_TABLEINFO "1" "September 2026" "Liblouis 3.39.0" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lou_tableinfo \- A tool to query metadata from a liblouis Braille translation table
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B lou_tableinfo
[\fI\,KEY\/\fR] \fI\,TABLE\/\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Print all table metadata defined in TABLE, or a specific metadata field
if KEY is specified. Return 0 if the requested metadata could be found,
1 otherwise.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
display this help and exit
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
display version information and exi
